msgstr ""
"Lo slug ipa ti ko lo, 2–40 lẹta kekere, awọn nọmba tabi awọn isalẹ, ti n "
"bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu lẹta kan."

#: includes/mcp/role-operations.php:142
